<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Ion Pacific Structured Liquidity - Fact Brief</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #1f2933;
      --muted: #66737f;
      --paper: #f7f5ef;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --line: #d8ddd9;
      --navy: #17324d;
      --teal: #1f7a78;
      --green: #4f8b5e;
      --gold: #bd862b;
      --red: #b85b4d;
      --blue: #527ca8;
      --soft-teal: #e7f2f0;
      --soft-gold: #f7eddc;
      --soft-red: #f5e7e4;
      --soft-blue: #eaf0f6;
      --soft-gray: #eef1ef;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(247, 245, 239, 0.96);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .nav-inner {
      display: flex;
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
      min-height: 58px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .brand {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 7px;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      padding: 7px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      background: var(--soft-gray);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .band {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .band.white {
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .band.blue {
      background: var(--soft-blue);
    }

    .band.gold {
      background: var(--soft-gold);
    }

    .inner {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 42px 0;
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(125deg, rgba(23, 50, 77, 0.99), rgba(23, 50, 77, 0.92) 56%, rgba(31, 122, 120, 0.88)),
        var(--navy);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: 4%;
      bottom: -84px;
      width: 440px;
      height: 310px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 24%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 24% 25%, transparent 25% 49%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 49% 50%, transparent 50% 74%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 74% 75%, transparent 75%),
        linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 24%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 24% 25%, transparent 25% 49%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 49% 50%, transparent 50% 74%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 74% 75%, transparent 75%);
      transform: rotate(-11deg);
      opacity: 0.75;
    }

    .hero .inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      padding-top: 58px;
      padding-bottom: 52px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      width: fit-content;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.28);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.84);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 22px 0 16px;
      font-size: 54px;
      line-height: 1.04;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .hero-lead {
      max-width: 870px;
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .hero-facts {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .hero-fact {
      min-height: 118px;
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.20);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
    }

    .hero-fact-label {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero-fact-value {
      margin-top: 7px;
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.08;
    }

    .hero-fact-note {
      margin-top: 7px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(280px, 0.52fr);
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .kicker {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--teal);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 31px;
      line-height: 1.14;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .section-head p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .grid-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .grid-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .grid-4 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .panel {
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(29, 38, 48, 0.06);
    }

    .panel p,
    .panel li {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .panel.soft {
      background: var(--soft-gray);
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .panel.teal {
      border-color: #c7dedb;
      background: var(--soft-teal);
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .panel.gold {
      border-color: #e2c58a;
      background: var(--soft-gold);
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .panel.red {
      border-color: #e3b6ad;
      background: var(--soft-red);
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      width: fit-content;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding: 5px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--soft-blue);
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .tag.teal {
      background: var(--soft-teal);
      color: var(--teal);
    }

    .tag.gold {
      background: #fff7e4;
      color: #805b1a;
    }

    .tag.red {
      background: var(--soft-red);
      color: #884236;
    }

    .plain-answer {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .answer-main {
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid #c7dedb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--soft-teal);
    }

    .answer-main h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .answer-main p {
      color: #285b5a;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .not-box {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .not-item {
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .not-item strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .not-item span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .money-flow {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 78px 1fr 78px 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .flow-node {
      min-height: 160px;
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .flow-node strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .flow-node span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .arrow {
      height: 42px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .arrow::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 20px;
      left: 4px;
      right: 14px;
      height: 3px;
      background: var(--teal);
    }

    .arrow::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 13px;
      right: 4px;
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      border-top: 3px solid var(--teal);
      border-right: 3px solid var(--teal);
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .waterfall {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 340px;
      gap: 22px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .waterfall-box {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .waterfall-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 160px minmax(0, 1fr) 88px;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .waterfall-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .row-label {
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .track {
      height: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--soft-gray);
    }

    .fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .row-value {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: right;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .term-table,
    .scenario-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      table-layout: fixed;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--white);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    th,
    td {
      padding: 12px 13px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    th {
      background: #edf1ef;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: left;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .num {
      text-align: right;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-flex;
      padding: 4px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .known {
      background: var(--soft-teal);
      color: var(--teal);
    }

    .open {
      background: var(--soft-gold);
      color: #805b1a;
    }

    .risk {
      background: var(--soft-red);
      color: #884236;
    }

    .structure-options {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .option-step {
      display: inline-grid;
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--soft-teal);
      color: var(--teal);
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .asset-bars {
      display: grid;
      gap: 11px;
    }

    .asset-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 190px minmax(0, 1fr) 74px;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .asset-name {
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .asset-track {
      height: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--soft-gray);
    }

    .asset-track span {
      display: block;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--teal), var(--blue));
    }

    .asset-value {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .callout {
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 15px 17px;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--red);
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: var(--soft-red);
      color: #743b32;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .callout.teal {
      border-left-color: var(--teal);
      background: var(--soft-teal);
      color: #235c5a;
    }

    .category-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .question-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 9px;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .question-list li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .question-list li::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 6px;
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border: 2px solid var(--teal);
      border-radius: 3px;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .takeaway-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 24px 0 34px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .nav-inner {
        display: block;
        padding: 12px 0;
      }

      .nav-links {
        justify-content: flex-start;
        margin-top: 8px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 42px;
      }

      .hero-facts,
      .grid-4,
      .grid-3,
      .structure-options,
      .takeaway-strip {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .section-head,
      .plain-answer,
      .waterfall {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .money-flow {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .arrow {
        height: 34px;
        transform: rotate(90deg);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .inner,
      .nav-inner {
        width: min(100% - 24px, 1180px);
      }

      .inner {
        padding: 30px 0;
      }

      .hero .inner {
        padding-top: 42px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 34px;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 25px;
      }

      .hero-facts,
      .grid-4,
      .grid-3,
      .grid-2,
      .structure-options,
      .category-grid,
      .takeaway-strip {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .waterfall-row,
      .asset-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 7px;
      }

      .row-value,
      .asset-value,
      .num {
        text-align: left;
      }

      .term-table,
      .scenario-table {
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      th,
      td {
        padding: 9px 8px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <div class="brand">Animoca Brands | Ion Pacific Fact Brief</div>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#what">What It Is</a>
        <a href="#flow">Money Flow</a>
        <a href="#structure">Structure</a>
        <a href="#terms">Terms</a>
        <a href="#scenarios">Scenarios</a>
        <a href="#questions">Questions</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="eyebrow">Ion Pacific structured liquidity proposal</div>
      <h1>Plain-English fact brief on the proposed portfolio-backed liquidity deal</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        Ion Pacific may provide $10m to $12.5m of liquidity against a basket of illiquid investments.
        This page explains the facts first: what the deal is, how money flows, what non-recourse means,
        what structures are possible, and where we still need answers.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-facts">
        <div class="hero-fact">
          <div class="hero-fact-label">Potential liquidity</div>
          <div class="hero-fact-value">$10m to $12.5m</div>
          <div class="hero-fact-note">Indicated by Ion after initial review.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-fact">
          <div class="hero-fact-label">Portfolio reference value</div>
          <div class="hero-fact-value">~$40m</div>
          <div class="hero-fact-note">$43m basket, $40m in model.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-fact">
          <div class="hero-fact-label">Ion's stated position</div>
          <div class="hero-fact-value">Non-recourse</div>
          <div class="hero-fact-note">Needs legal confirmation.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-fact">
          <div class="hero-fact-label">Current state</div>
          <div class="hero-fact-value">Exploratory</div>
          <div class="hero-fact-note">No final terms yet.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="band white" id="what">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">Facts first</div>
          <h2>What is this deal?</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          The easiest way to read it: Animoca gets cash now, Ion gets a senior claim on future proceeds from a defined investment basket, and then shares in upside after its senior claim is recovered.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="plain-answer">
        <div class="answer-main">
          <h3>It is portfolio-backed liquidity, not a simple sale and not a normal loan.</h3>
          <p>
            Animoca is not simply selling the whole portfolio today. Ion is offering cash upfront against future distributions
            from selected illiquid investments. The exact legal form is still open, but the commercial idea is a waterfall:
            Ion gets paid first, then remaining upside is shared.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="not-box">
          <div class="not-item">
            <strong>Not a clean asset sale</strong>
            <span>Ion says Animoca can retain full shareholding, voting rights, and board seats where applicable.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="not-item">
            <strong>Not a plain loan</strong>
            <span>Ion says it is non-recourse, meaning recovery should be limited to the basket / proceeds.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="not-item">
            <strong>Closer to NAV financing</strong>
            <span>Cash now in exchange for senior recovery plus upside participation in future proceeds.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout teal">
        Key framing: the deal may give liquidity without an outright sale, but it can still be expensive because Ion receives priority economics and may receive upside participation.
      </div>
      <div class="callout">
        Open point: if a single asset exits, we need to know whether those proceeds are immediately swept through the waterfall or tracked at the total basket level. This affects how much cash Animoca keeps from early exits and when Ion's PIK stops accruing.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="flow">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">Illustration</div>
          <h2>How money flows</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          The facts from Ion's email and the illustrative model point to this sequence. Final PIK rate and split remain open.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="money-flow">
        <div class="flow-node">
          <strong>1. Ion funds cash</strong>
          <span>Ion provides $10m to $12.5m through a dedicated deal SPV.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="flow-node">
          <strong>2. Portfolio generates proceeds</strong>
          <span>Future exits or distributions from the basket are paid into the deal waterfall.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="flow-node">
          <strong>3. Waterfall allocates proceeds</strong>
          <span>Ion recovers capital plus PIK first. After Level 1, residual upside is shared.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 18px;">
        <div class="panel teal">
          <div class="tag teal">Level 1</div>
          <h3>Ion gets paid first</h3>
          <p>All proceeds first go to Ion until it recovers invested capital plus accrued PIK / preferred return.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel gold">
          <div class="tag gold">PIK stops</div>
          <h3>PIK does not run forever</h3>
          <p>Ion clarified that PIK accrues only until Waterfall Level 1 is recovered, then the upside-sharing layer begins.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel red">
          <div class="tag red">Five-year trigger</div>
          <h3>Potential sale right</h3>
          <p>If Level 1 is not recovered within five years, Ion would typically require the right to sell part of the underlying assets.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band white">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">Plain-English definition</div>
          <h2>What does non-recourse mean here?</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          This is the most important downside concept. Non-recourse is helpful only if the legal documents truly limit Ion to the agreed basket / proceeds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="panel teal">
          <div class="tag teal">If truly non-recourse</div>
          <h3>Ion's downside is limited to the basket</h3>
          <p>
            If Ion invests $10m and expects to recover $15.7m, but the portfolio only produces $6m,
            Ion should get $6m and absorb the shortfall. Ion should not be able to demand the missing amount from Animoca's other cash or assets.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel red">
          <div class="tag red">What would weaken this</div>
          <h3>Backdoor recourse</h3>
          <p>
            We should check for any guarantee, NAV top-up, margin call, asset replacement obligation,
            mandatory buyback, cross-collateral, or repayment obligation outside the basket proceeds.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="structure">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="section-head">
